Package: situc
Version: @VERSION@
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11)
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Homepage: https://github.com/funklord/situ
Description: compiler for situ byte-layout schemas
 situ is a schema language for data whose layout is decided by somebody else:
 network protocols, file formats and device registers, where the bytes are
 fixed and the reader has to match them exactly.
 .
 A schema states what the bytes are, and situc derives accessors for C, C++,
 Rust and Python from it, along with a capability map saying what each field
 costs to reach, a Wireshark dissector, a fuzz harness and a test suite that
 holds the generated code to the map.
 .
 This package contains the compiler. The C runtime the generated C needs is
 in libsitu-dev.
